                    <h3>RigidBody2D</h3>
                    <p class="meta">C++ · CMake · raylib</p>
                    <p>
                        A 2D rigid-body simulation in C++ with real-time visualization,
                        collision detection and response, and a simple broad phase based 
                        on sorting and axis pruning.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <a href="https://github.com/starrylume/RigidBody2D-GL">GitHub</a>
                    </p>
